  "description": "B-State is a lightweight state manager for Blazor that simplifies complex state handling. It features a pipeline architecture with preprocessors and postprocessors to transform state before and after changes, reusable behaviors for shared logic, and seamless integration with Blazor's component lifecycle. B-State makes state management in Blazor applications more maintainable and predictable.",
